<</BBox[22.864 573.223 612.014 635.32]/Contents(Owners should respond in writing or make payments to the address as directed by the designated agent. For the purpose of OVERNIGHT PAYMENTS \rmail to: Autumn Terrace at William Owners' Association, C/O Banc of California, Common Interest Management Services 3023, 501 Canal Boulevard, \rSuite E, Richmond, CA 94804. For the purpose of CORRESPONDENCE mail to: Autumn Terrace at William Owners' Association, c/o Common Interest Management Services, 262 East Hamilton Avenue Ste. D, Campbell, CA 95008. These addresses are subject to change after the distribution of this policy. Notification of a change will be in writing to the membership through normal day-to-day correspondence from the association or its managing agent. \rIt is the owners responsibility to note any changes for their records.\r)/DS(text-decoration:;font-size:12.00pt;font-family:'Times New Roman')/Filter/FlateDecode/GUID(6334b693-ea37-4328-bf-93c79817b28fbe)/IT/Typewriter/Matrix[1 0 0 1 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0" ?> <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.0.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" style = "font-size:12.00pt;font-family:'Times New Roman'"><p><span style="text-decoration:;font-size:9.00pt">Owners should respond in writing or make payments to the address as directed by the designated agent. For the purpose of OVERNIGHT PAYMENTS &#13;</span></p><p><span style="text-decoration:;font-size:9.00pt">mail to: Autumn Terrace at William Owners' Association, C/O Banc of California, Common Interest Management Services 3023, 501 Canal Boulevard, &#13;</span></p><p><span style="text-decoration:;font-size:9.00pt">Suite E, Richmond, CA 94804. For the purpose of CORRESPONDENCE mail to: Autumn Terrace at William Owners' Association, c/o Common Interest Management Services, 262 East Hamilton Avenue Ste. D, Campbell, CA 95008. These addresses are subject to change after the distribution of this policy. Notification of a change will be in writing to the membership through normal day-to-day correspondence from the association or its managing agent. &#13;</span></p><p><span style="text-decoration:;font-size:9.00pt">It is the owners&#8217; responsibility to note any changes for their records.</span><span style="text-decoration:;font-size:9.00pt;font-family:'Arial'">&#13;</span></p></body>)/Rect[22.864 573.223 612.014 635.32]/Resources<</Font<</F0 248 0 R/F1 249 0 R>>/ProcSet[/PDF/Text/ImageB/ImageC/ImageI]>>/Rotate 0/Subtype/Form/Length 629>>stream
